[_description]
Package: com.snowgears.shop (root). Shop.java main plugin class: getMaxDisplayDistance, getShopSearchRadius, getDisplayBatchSize, getDisplayBatchDelay.

[_summary]
Main plugin entry point for Shop. Handles plugin lifecycle (onEnable/onDisable), economy setup via VaultUnlocked, GriefPrevention3D hook registration, GeyserMC/Floodgate compatibility wiring, configuration loading, and command registration.

[_does]
Initializes the Shop plugin, loads configuration, sets up economy via VaultUnlocked, registers GriefPrevention3D hook, wires GeyserMC/Floodgate compatibility, registers commands and listeners.

[_careful]

[_careful/Compatibility]
Depends on VaultUnlocked (same net.milkbowl.vault.* packages as VaultAPI — no import changes needed). Geyser API via GeyserApi.api(), Floodgate via FloodgateApi.getInstance(). GriefPrevention3D uses same me.ryanhamshire.GriefPrevention package as standard GP.

[_conclusions]
Shop.java is the central coordination point for all compatibility integrations (VaultUnlocked, GriefPrevention3D, Geyser/Floodgate).

